    <!--
      The tile banner. The app screen keeps its own snooze button, but the tile
      is the way in (SPEC.md §4.2) — easier, and where people already go to
      silence a phone — so the screen leads with it rather than listing it as
      one option among equals.

      "Don't ask again" (maintainer, 2026-08-13), not "Not now": the dismissal
      is permanent and is not re-raised even when the tile is later removed, and
      "Not now" would promise the opposite. The row below the banner is the
      standing route, so saying it plainly costs the reminder and not the
      capability. Shorter than the "Don't show again" it replaces, and the more
      common idiom for a dismissal that sticks.
    -->
